WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.100
Some postings hide instructions meant
for AI, like white text on a white page.

2
00:00:06.165 --> 00:00:09.114
Job Radar strips them out
before the AI reads the job,

3
00:00:09.114 --> 00:00:11.165
and shows you exactly what it found.

4
00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:15.465
Your score isn't touched.
The AI just reads the real job.
